Read-only probes for the inventory slice: the visible carry page, the
on-screen center of carry and equip cells, the effect pairs of own slots
(EF_AMOUNT 61 = stack size) and the item attached to the cursor, and
the own Damage/Ac last sent by the server. The harness
drags and right-clicks with real mouse input; nothing here sends a packet or
changes state.

